er-orchestration)\\n8. [API Documentation (OpenAPI / Swagger)](#-api-documentation-openapi--swagger)\\n9. [Pre-Seeded Demo Accounts](#-pre-seeded-demo-accounts)\\n10. [Academic Submission Deliverables](#-academic-submission-deliverables)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🌟 Key Features & Capabilities\\n\\n- **Tamper-Evident Digital Fingerprinting (Bonus Feature)**: Every qualification is bound to a deterministic SHA-256 cryptographic signature that immediately detects forged or modified credential records.\\n- **Public & Institutional Verification Portal**: Instant, transparent credential lookup with visual genuine/revoked/tampered bad\n<truncated 4037 bytes>","Description":"\"Create comprehensive README.md file\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Madziva\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\qualification-verification-system\\\\README.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating README.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Create README.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
